<title>UK: UK official reserves fall underlying $2 mln in Jun.</title>
<headline>UK official reserves fall underlying $2 mln in Jun.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's gold and currency reserves fell an underlying $2 million in June, the Treasury said. (in million dollars except where stated).</p>
<p>				JUNE	     MAY</p>
<p>Underlying reserves	-2		-26</p>
<p>Actual reserves	   -13		-43</p>
<p>Total actual reserves   40.56 bln	40.57 bln</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
